      "content": "let it go? what does that even mean. you mean just like... give up? everything i worked for, my whole reputation, it's just gonna be a joke to everyone when they see how i ended up. i feel like i'm just waiting for the moment everyone realizes i'm a failure. is there even a way to keep any dignity at this point?",
